## 3. Subjects and Data Dimensions

| Subject | Trials | Sessions | Beta shape | nsdgeneral voxels |
|---------|--------|----------|------------|-------------------|
| subj01 | 30,000 | 40 | (81, 104, 83, 750) | ~15,724 |
| subj02 | 30,000 | 40 | (82, 106, 84, 750) | ~15,xxx (varies) |
| subj05 | 30,000 | 40 | varies | varies |
| subj07 | 30,000 | 40 | varies | varies |

Each session file has 750 trial volumes. Each trial maps to one `nsdId` (stimulus image ID, 0-72999).
There are ~10,000 unique images, each shown ~3 times per subject.
`shared1000`: 1,000 images seen by all 8 NSD subjects (reserved for paper-grade evaluation).

