## 11. Training Script Key Details

**Script**: `scripts/training/train_unified.py`

- Loads config YAML, resolves subject, sets seed
- Data: `PreextractedNSDDataset` (preferred) or `NSDDataset` (NIfTI fallback)
- CLIP embeddings: loaded from `clip.parquet`, joined on `nsdId`
- Preprocessing: optional `EmbeddingPreprocessor` (center_pcr, fitted on training embeddings)
- Model: `create_model(config, roi_indices)` — `input_dim` inferred from data
- ROI indices: computed via `build_roi_index(subject)` from NSD atlas files
- Training: AdamW, cosine LR scheduler, warmup, gradient clipping, AMP (float16)
- Validation: full-set retrieval metrics (R@1, R@5, R@10, MRR, MedianRank)
- Early stopping: on `val_r@1` (higher is better) or `val_loss` (lower is better)
- Checkpoints: `best.pt` + `last.pt` in `experimental_results/{exp}/{subj}/checkpoints/`
- Metrics: `summary.json` + `training_log.csv` in `metrics/`

