## 15. Key Retrieval Metrics

- **R@1**: fraction of test samples whose ground truth is the top-1 retrieved item (primary metric)
- **R@5, R@10**: top-5/10 retrieval accuracy
- **MRR**: mean reciprocal rank
- **Median Rank**: median position of ground truth in ranked gallery
- Gallery = all CLIP embeddings in the validation/test set

## 16. Novel Contributions (N-series experiments)

- **N1 (vMF-NCE)**: von Mises-Fisher distribution on the hypersphere instead of Gaussian in Euclidean space. Bessel-free NCE loss. Bounded-sigmoid kappa parameterization.
- **N2 (ROI Transformer)**: brain-topology-aware tokenization — each ROI becomes a separate token with its own projection, processed by a Transformer encoder.
- **N3 (ROI-DCF)**: Directional Consensus Fusion — per-ROI vMF expert heads whose predictions are fused via spherical weighted averaging using attention-derived alphas.
- **N4 (Full System)**: combines all innovations + Self-Paced Curriculum Learning (SPCL) on kappa + Decomposed Uncertainty-Aware CFG for diffusion guidance.
